  "steps": [
    "Boil the soya chunks, then squeeze out all the water.",
    "In a kadhai, heat the ghee and add the jeera, chopped garlic and chillies.",
    "Add the onion and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the peas and cook for 5 minutes. If using frozen peas, soak them in lukewarm water for a while first.",
    "Add salt, red chilli powder, aamchur, garam masala, coriander powder, a pinch of haldi and some rock salt, and mix well.",
    "Add the rice flour and mix again.",
    "Transfer to a grinder jar with the half slice of bread and the coriander, and grind to a fine paste.",
    "Add the soya chunks and grind again.",
    "Keep the paste in the fridge for 10 minutes.",
    "Oil your hands and shape the paste into small balls.",
    "Brush a non-stick pan with ghee and cook the kebabs on low-medium heat for a few minutes, until nicely browned.",
    "Serve with Greek yogurt; top the yogurt with red chilli powder, chaat masala and pomegranate."
  ],
